<Layout title="Privacy & Demo Information"><article class="wrap policy section"><p class="eyebrow">A NOTE ABOUT THIS PROJECT</p><h1>An imagined house.<br/><em>A real design exercise.</em></h1><h2>About DAR SERA</h2><p>DAR SERA is a fictional guesthouse. The property, rooms, amenities, policies and rates are demonstration content. This website does not offer accommodation, accept reservations, take payments or arrange transport.</p><h2>Images and location</h2><p>The supplied guesthouse and destination images are generated visual assets. Destination illustrations are not documentary photographs. No exact property address, map location or historic attribution is provided. The house diagram is schematic and not to scale.</p><h2>Your stay plan</h2><p>The form runs in your browser. The application does not send your name, email address or note to a server, email service or booking provider. Contact fields are held only in the current page’s memory and are cleared when the page is refreshed or closed.</p><p>If you choose to copy a stay summary, its dates, room, guest count and demo total are placed on your device’s clipboard. Your name, email and note are excluded from that copied summary.</p><h2>Storage and external links</h2><p>The application does not set analytics or advertising cookies, load third-party maps, or use persistent storage for contact details. Hosting providers may process standard request information under their own policies. External links open services whose privacy practices are separate from this website.</p><h2>Access information</h2><p>Upper-floor rooms and the rooftop require stairs. No verified accessible accommodation or step-free route is represented.</p><a class="text-link" href="/">Return to the house <span>↗</span></a></article></Layout>
